  Euclidean or 2-norm, the inf-norm, and in general the p-norm for p > 0) and
  matrix norms (Frobenius, 1-norm, 2-norm and inf-norm).

  Args:
    tensor: `Tensor` of types `float32`, `float64`, `complex64`, `complex128`
